aragraph3">Legendary performance meets new transmission technology for more power and control. The RYAN Jr. Sod Cutter – Hydro’s innovative, hydrostatic, variable-speed transmission lets you power through the cut while its heavy-duty, long-lasting,  cast-iron gear case and hydraulic cooling system stand up  to the toughest demands—season after season. </p><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-kMriOJ brNffh pf-196_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bdOgOc bNKfVA pf-197_ pf-text-1"><b>POWERFUL HYDROSTATIC TRANSMISSION</b> <br>A specifically designed hydraulic cooling system  and Hydro-Gear® BDU transmission—featuring  both forward and reverse drive—turn up the  power without sacrificing durability.</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bdOgOc bNKfVA pf-199_ pf-text-1"><b>INTUITIVE CONTROLS</b> <br>A user-friendly, color-coded interface makes it  easy to adjust blade depth and angle for precise cutting—no matter the soil condition.</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bdOgOc bNKfVA pf-201_ pf-text-1"><b>PNEUMATIC SWIVELING REAR WHEEL</b> <br>Unlock the pneumatic rear caster wheel to easily— and tightly—maneuver around landscaping, then lock it for unmatched precision on straightways.</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bdOgOc bNKfVA pf-203_ pf-text-1"><b>ULTRA-LOW VIBRATION TECHNOLOGY</b> <br>A rubber isolation mount absorbs shock and machine vibration before they ever reach your hands, saving your arms from fatigue.</li></ul><div data-product-id="9819451621681" data-default-variant="49480737653041" data-pf-type="ProductBox" class="sc-lfYA-dV coXtEf pf-205_">{% assign defaultProduct = product %}{% assign product = product_9819451621681 %}{% if product != null %}{% form "product", product, data-productid: product.id, class: "pf-product-form" %}<div class="sc-dhKdPU hjOBND pf-206_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-iapVNj iUcVvL pf-207_"><div data-product-id="{{ product.id }}" data-media-id="{% liquid
