_"><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-uVXKs hcsbjh pf-234_ pf-divider-2"></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-dhKdPU hjOBND pf-238_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-iapVNj iUcVvL pf-239_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-kAkozD kgiAhT pf-240_ pf-heading-5-h3">Lawnaire&nbsp;ZTS Stand-On Aerator</h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-kAkozD kgiAhT pf-242_ pf-heading-7-h3">The Revolution is Here</h3><p class="sc-gFVuLS jpmtwg pf-244_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">With aeration season being short, you need a swift, efficient machine that saves you time while increasing your productivity. The Lawnaire ZTS does just that, capable of covering two-and-a-quarter acres per hour at ground speeds up to 7 mph. Its innovative features and controls also give you the power and speed to take on the biggest jobs.</p><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-kMriOJ brNffh pf-246_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bdOgOc bNKfVA pf-247_ pf-text-1"><b>INTUITIVE CONTROLS  &amp; ZERO-TURN OPERATION</b> <br>Grip terrain and navigate obstacles with simple, easy-to-use controls while being  able to adjust tine depth on-the-go.</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bdOgOc bNKfVA pf-249_ pf-text-1"><b>REVOLUTIONARY, AUTOMATIC  CHAIN-TENSIONING SYSTEM</b> <br>Innovative, automatic chain-tensioning ensures proper tension is maintained during operation, reducing chain maintenance and downtime.</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-bdOgOc bNKfVA pf-251_ pf-text-1"><b>FLIP-UP OPERATOR PLATFORM  WITH  QUICK LATCH</b> <br>A flip-up operator platform with  a quick latch changes the machine  to a walk-behind aerator and reduces  the machine’s footprint for trailer  transport. </li></ul></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-iapVNj iUcVvL pf-253_"><div class="sc-dhKdPU hjOBND pf-254_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-iapVNj iUcVvL pf-255_"><div data-product-id="8381500227889" data-default-variant="45124673241393" data-pf-type="ProductBox" class="sc-lfYA-dV coXtEf pf-256_">{% assign defaultProduct = product %}{% assign product = product_8381500227889 %}{% if product != null %}{% form "product", product, data-productid: product.id, class: "pf-product-form" %}<div class="sc-dhKdPU hjOBND pf-257_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-iapVNj iUcVvL pf-258_"><div data-product-id="{{ product.id }}" data-media-id="{% liquid
